      <h2 id="ossm-specifying-external-kiali_kiali-config-ref" class="group scroll-mt-20">Specifying Kiali configuration in a Kiali custom resource<a href="#ossm-specifying-external-kiali_kiali-config-ref" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>You can fully customize your Kiali deployment by configuring Kiali in the Kiali custom resource (CR) rather than in the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> (SMCP) resource. This configuration is sometimes called an "external Kiali" since the configuration is specified outside of the SMCP.</p>
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Note</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>You must deploy the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> and Kiali custom resources in the same namespace. For example, <code>istio-system</code>.</p>
